EPrincess Amie has lost her tiara! Find the tiara and return it to her. Collect coins to gain extra lives. Set the birds free, and they will build platforms for you in the final battle.

Controls:
4,6 = run sideways
2 = jump up
1,3 = jump diagonally
8 = enter passages
5 = skip animations

Hint: Rumours tell there are two secret rooms in the level! Collect all the coins to make it to the bonus game.

Bonus game instructions: Place coins into the slots. When the slot is full, coins are spread to adjacent slots. The game is over when all the opponent's coins have been conquered.